You most probably know about the Anarchist putsch who
enflamed the town of Tanabe, well it fell on me, I had to
interrupt my game of golf, just when I was beating General
Bishop.

Well these putschists are going to learn not to disturb
Alex Kolman during his golf. Leave straight away for our
base of Mekano.

This is the situation :

Tanabe is situated at a few cables length away to the
north-west. The anarchist trend has always been very present
and it seems that Colonel Natkrof, the commanding officer of
the Tanabe garrison, hasn't been insensitive to this ideology.
But the fact remains that our ally of yesterday, is today
our enemy.

Do not forget that Psychos and Paranos are in the area,
waiting, like vultures, to see what turn events will take.

Bring-me back Natkrof's head, so that I can start playing
polo with it.